# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ASAMU-decomp source hygiene
#
# This repository is PUBLIC. It contains only our own code, tooling, tests,
# format documentation and sanitized metadata. Original game payloads, raw
# reverse-engineering dumps and decompiler output must never be committed.
# See docs/LEGAL.md and CLAUDE.md ("Original game hygiene").
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Rust build output -------------------------------------------------------
/target/
**/target/
*.pdb

